##!
# Learning settings. The recording changes some of these between decisions, as an environment
# would.

rl --set learning on
# A trip ends when everyone is across. Without temporal extension, the last crossing's value
# comes from its reward alone and doesn't reach into the next trip.
rl --set temporal-extension off
decide indifferent-selection --epsilon-greedy
decide indifferent-selection --epsilon 0.1
